    "created_at": "2015-12-16T00:22:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-16T00:22:35Z",
    "body": "As I mentioned in the other issue, we should think about what parts of the delaying we want to expose to the web page which initiated the request.\n\nIf we let the webpage see the timing of when the request goes out, that will severely limit our flexibility in choosing that timing. And we'll have to precisely define what that timing should be so that it's consistent across browsers.\n",
